  "input": "When did Boreal take over the ledger?\n[2025-12-10] handover/2025-12-10-ledger: Atlas handed the ledger to the Boreal team today; Priya wrote up the handover doc for Lena. [2026-04-29] handover/2026-04-29-ledger: Cinder is taking over the ledger from team Boreal, effective today. Dashboards and alerts are being repointed. [2026-03-17] standup/boreal/2026-03-17: Team change: Marcus leaves Boreal and joins the Atlas team, effective today. Boreal saw that the resizer's cold start time tripled following the runtime upgrade; not their service, so they flagged it.",
